example {
  name: Add sub-category
  description: Creates a sub-category under a parent category to further organize products. For example, under "Electronics" you might have "Smartphones", "Laptops", "Cameras". Sub-categories must belong to an existing category and each sub-category needs a unique name and an image. The system automatically generates a slug and organizes images in a nested folder structure based on the parent category.
  
